  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Providing Sustainable Integrated Resettlement Solutions for IDPs in 4 Governorates of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide an integrated package of housing, livelihoods, and social cohesion support to IDPs and host communities in four Iraqi governorates to enable sustainable reintegration and prevent recurrence of forced displacement&#xc8fc;&#xac70; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xae30;&#xbc18;&#xc2dc;&#xc124; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc0dd;&#xd65c; &#xc5ec;&#xac74; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xc778;&#xd504;&#xb77c; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;, &#xc2e4;&#xd5a5;&#xbbfc;&#xacfc; &#xc218;&#xc6a9;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xc8fc;&#xbbfc;&#xc758; &#xc0dd;&#xaf10; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xc801; &#xacb0;&#xc18d;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of 314 destroyed houses and rehabilitation of 300 damaged homes, Upgrading 10 community infrastructure sites (water, electricity, education, health), Climate-resilient agriculture training and toolkit provision (168 farmers), SME capacity-building and start-up grants (336 persons), Mental health and psychosocial support (MHPSS), Community cohesion, peace promotion, and peace journalism training, Social integration monitoring via SCORE index.</narrative>
  </description>
